  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "What is a common chord?"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- For circles that **intersect twice** the **common chord** is the line that joins the points of intersection\n- This line is a **chord** in both circles\n\n  - Circles that intersect once (touch) have a common tangent"
  },
